<title>USA: U.S. lead stocks up in February - ABMS.</title>
<headline>U.S. lead stocks up in February - ABMS.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lead stocks held by U.S. refiners rose to 13,043 short tons at the end of February from 9,324 short tons at the end of January, said American Bureau of Metal Statistics.</p>
<p>Production of lead fell to 31,454 short tons in the month from 31,732 short tons in January.</p>
<p>Shipments from plants fell to 27,761 short tons in February from 31,493 short tons in the previous month.</p>
<p>--New York Commodity Desk 212-859-1640</p>
